# Tailwind utility

Style with Tailwind utilities, `tools/tailwind-config/theme.css`, and `@namma-medmate/shared-ui`.

No new component `.css` files, CSS modules, or styled-components. Translate Stitch HTML into Tailwind classes — do not paste a second stylesheet.

```tsx
// BAD
import './auth-widget.css';
export function AuthWidget() { return <div className="widget" />; }

// GOOD
export function AuthWidget() {
  return <section className="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-lg p-6">{/* ... */}</section>;
}
```
